# The build context holds only what Dockerfile copies, so a change to
# any other file does not rebuild this image. The Go build reads the
# module files, the root package's Go sources, `openapi.json`, which
# the package embeds, and `edl/`.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!*.go
!openapi.json
!edl/
# go build reads no test file or testdata.
**/*_test.go
**/testdata/
